```md
# Accessibility

Every interactive element must be accessible.

Use:

```tsx
accessibilityRole
accessibilityLabel
accessibilityHint
accessibilityState
````

when appropriate.

Do not make icon-only buttons without an accessible label.

Support dynamic text sizes where possible.

Maintain sufficient touch target sizes.

